OL,3,GNEWSAMan thought he had drugged wife's
OL,4,Aconsent, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of four men on trial for sexually
OL,7,Fabusing a woman who had been drugged by
OL,8,Fher husband thought he had her consent
OL,9,Fand stopped when she became
OL,10,Funcomfortable, a court has heard.
OL,12,FPhilip Young, a former Tory councillor
OL,13,Ffor Swindon, has admitted to drugging
OL,14,Fand raping his now ex-wife Joanne over
OL,15,Fa 13-year period.
OL,17,FFour men who Young is alleged to have
OL,18,Frecruited to abuse his wife at their
OL,19,Fhome are now on trial at Winchester
OL,20,FCrown Court.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
