OL,6,FThe jury heard that Connor
OL,7,FSanderson-Doyle, 32, told police he
OL,8,Fthought he was helping a married couple
OL,9,Fto "live out their kink" but left after
OL,10,Fgetting the "vibe [Joanne] wasn't
OL,11,Fenjoying it".
